Given this interface:

public interface INotificationSender
{
    Task SendAsync(NotificationMessage message, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default);
    bool CanHandle(NotificationChannel channel);
}

Implement EmailNotificationSender using an injected ISmtpClient and ITemplateRenderer. CanHandle should return true only for NotificationChannel.Email. SendAsync should render the message body from a template keyed by message.TemplateId, then send via the SMTP client, retrying once on transient SmtpException.
